{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121456","id":4069821158,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7ylIrm","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121456","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121456.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121456.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121456","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121456/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121456/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121456/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/031a28b67c18af4d1e8f37a404a85078805a6ffd","number":121456,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix crash capturing script backtraces when ScriptBacktrace is disabled by build profile","user":{"login":"WSQS","id":17792626,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzkyNjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17792626?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WSQS","html_url":"https://github.com/WSQS","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WSQS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WSQS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WSQS/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WSQS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WSQS/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WSQS/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WSQS/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WSQS/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WSQS/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This is a resubmission of #121444.\n\n**Reproduction:**\nAt build time, put `ScriptBacktrace` into `disabled_classes` in the file passed to scons as `build_profile`, and add a node whose type is also in `disabled_classes` to a scene.\n\n**Cause of the crash:**\nA read-to-write lock upgrade in ClassDB. When ClassDB meets a disabled class type during scene instantiation, it calls the `_err_print_error` macro while holding the read lock. Inside, it calls into ScriptServer, and if this is the first call, it enters ScriptBacktrace's class registration, which then tries to take the write lock in ClassDB, and the lock upgrade causes the crash.\n\n**Fix:**\nCall ScriptBacktrace's class registration early in `ScriptServer::init_languages()`, so that when the same situation happens later, the registration will not run again.\n\n**Other fix considered:**\nAdjust the logic in ClassDB to release the lock before calling the `_err_print_error` macro. That change would be bigger, so I chose the current approach.\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","description":"","color":"885544","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-07-16T15:15:00Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T16:29:57Z","closed_at":"2026-10-14T16:29:41Z","mer